-- Central declarations of the local flat-unramified development.
-- Expected openings include the finite relations and witness records,
-- polynomial/list and fraction representations, and the concrete quotient
-- operations used to identify the charts.  In particular, ring, Carrier,
-- Q, image, operation, choose, map and induction include the quotient
-- implementation, not just mathematical operation names.  The README
-- explains the constructions these definitions implement.
-- This is a regression specification, not a restriction on kernel trust.
